<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H3
/P 79 0 R
/T (Hey everyone, welcome to UNCSTD \(or you can just call it the CSTD\) at DPSIMUN 2026! My name is Arnav Pratap Maan, and I am thrilled to serve as your Chair for this session, bringing my experience as a chair last year at the DPSIMUN 2025. Transitioning from being a delegate to chairing committees taught me that behind all the formal terminology and parliamentary procedure, the best MUN sessions come down to real engagement, strategic thinking and having some fun along the way.)
/E (Hey everyone, welcome to UNCSTD \(or you can just call it the CSTD\) at DPSIMUN 2026! My name is Arnav Pratap Maan, and I am thrilled to serve as your Chair for this session, bringing my experience as a chair last year at the DPSIMUN 2025. Transitioning from being a delegate to chairing committees taught me that behind all the formal terminology and parliamentary procedure, the best MUN sessions come down to real engagement, strategic thinking and having some fun along the way.)
/Pg 13 0 R
/K [5]
>>
