/T (A UN-aligned body provides an agile regulatory structure to manage the immediate deployment of advanced tech during catastrophic events. Activation relies on objective triggers, including UN Level 3 Humanitarian Emergencies and severe infrastructure failures. During active crises, the council issues time-bound legal indemnities, enabling humanitarian groups to field life-saving tools instantly without regulatory delays.)
/E (A UN-aligned body provides an agile regulatory structure to manage the immediate deployment of advanced tech during catastrophic events. Activation relies on objective triggers, including UN Level 3 Humanitarian Emergencies and severe infrastructure failures. During active crises, the council issues time-bound legal indemnities, enabling humanitarian groups to field life-saving tools instantly without regulatory delays.)
