/P 87 0 R
/T (Developing nations often lack the financial capital and technical infrastructure required to deploy localized smart grids. Targeted technology transfer and dedicated multilateral funding mechanisms are crucial for financing off-grid solar and microgrid projects. Prioritizing local workforce training ensures host communities can independently operate and maintain these decentralized systems long term.)
/E (Developing nations often lack the financial capital and technical infrastructure required to deploy localized smart grids. Targeted technology transfer and dedicated multilateral funding mechanisms are crucial for financing off-grid solar and microgrid projects. Prioritizing local workforce training ensures host communities can independently operate and maintain these decentralized systems long term.)
