/Title (A UN-aligned body provides an agile regulatory structure to manage the immediate deployment of advanced tech during catastrophic events. Activation relies on objective triggers, including UN Level 3 Humanitarian Emergencies and severe infrastructure failures. During active crises, the council issues time-bound legal indemnities, enabling humanitarian groups to field life-saving tools instantly without regulatory delays.)
/Dest [17 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 1061 0 R
>>
endobj
1071 0 obj
<<
/Title (Standardized technical risk assessments evaluate emergency platforms prior to deployment to measure data sensitivity and security threats. Using zero-knowledge architecture and localized encryption ensures host nations maintain full ownership over sensitive demographic and spatial data. Role-based access controls and automated sunset clauses further protect systems by erasing operational data once the crisis ends.)
/Dest [17 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 1062 0 R
>>
endobj
